            <div xml:id="d480-a1">

                <pb facs="0605" n="497" sameAs="frus:frus1893/pg497"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 1 in No.
                    34.—Translation.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Prime minister to Mirza Jafer, financial
                        secretary.</hi></head>
                <p>For what reason has his excellency Hajie Seyyah’s salary, which he has hitherto
                    enjoyed, and which has always been paid by the Government, not been entered in
                    the accounts, and has, without orders, been struck out of the books? You will
                    reenter it without fail, in the book in the same manner as before. You will also
                    give him his receipt, properly sealed, so that he may have no further trouble in
                    the matter.</p>
                <closer><signed>[Seal of the Sadr Azem.]</signed>
                    <lb/>
